gantt
    title Gateway cutover for shop.example.com
    dateFormat HH:mm
    axisFormat %H:%M
    section DNS
    Lower TTL to 60 s (an hour before)   :done, ttl, 09:00, 10m
    Switch A record to 192.0.2.40         :crit, sw, 10:00, 5m
    section Proof
    Curl through the new gateway first     :pre, 09:45, 15m
    Check public DNS and real traffic      :after sw, 20m
    section Rollback window
    Old ingress kept serving               :active, keep, 10:00, 60m
    Point of no return (old ingress off)   :milestone, crit, 11:00, 0m
